  "text": "Skip to content\nLocal preview\nDraft content · 9 October 2026\nartifactory.\nMenu\nHome\nProjects\n\nOUR PROJECTS\n\nTwo projects. Shared curiosity.\n\nSensing technology and photonic engineering tools, each with its own development path and evidence.\n\nARTISENSE / 01\nPHOTONICS\nSIGNAL\nLIGHT\n01 / PHOTONIC SENSING\nResearch & concept development\nArtiSense\n\nExploring how light can reveal chemical information, with a miniaturized sensing system at the heart of the research.\n\nExplore ArtiSense\nOPTICAL FIELD\nCONCEPTUAL ILLUSTRATION\nAIFIELD\n02 / PHOTONIC ENGINEERING\nDevelopment & internal demonstrations\nAIFIELD\n\nA design and simulation environment for exploring photonic systems, with AI-assisted workflows and a distinct neural field research direction.\n\nExplore AIFIELD\n\nConceptual illustration · not a product image or measured result\n\nAT A GLANCE\n\nDifferent questions. Connected work.\nPerspective\tArtiSense\tAIFIELD\nFocus\tSensing systems\tDesign & simulation tools\nIntended output\tA miniaturized chemical-sensing system\tA photonic design and simulation workflow\nStage in supplied material\tResearch & concept development\tDevelopment & internal demonstrations\nEvidence boundary\tDesign work does not validate sensing performance\tSimulation comparisons do not establish fabricated-device results\nResearch & validation\nExamples & validation\n\nTHE NEXT CONVERSATION\n\nLet’s explore what\ncomes next.\n\nInvest in the company. Explore the science. Bring a question worth working on.\n\nDiscuss an investment\nExplore partnerships\nartifactory.\n\nEngineering light. Creating possibility.\n\nSensing technology and tools for designing photonic systems.\nProjects\nAll projects\nArtiSense\nAIFIELD\nCompany\nHome\nInvestors\nOur approach\nAbout\nPartnerships\nGet in touch\ninfo@artifactory.tech\nContact\nPrivacy\nArtifactory · 2026\nLocal review edition. Content and Polish translations await owner review.\nBack to top ↑",
